# The codes `chart` fails with, kept in one place so that every module of the
# package fails alike.

# The code of an input the function does not read, which the face names as
# `chart.INVALID`.
constant INVALID: str
    "invalid"

# The code of an image larger than the package draws, which the face names as
# `chart.LIMIT`.
constant LIMIT: str
    "limit"

## Tests

test "codes: the two codes are the library's words"
    assert INVALID == "invalid"
    assert LIMIT == "limit"
